                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>The shape of your lab-grown diamond dramatically affects the ring's character. MiaDonna offers engagement rings in all of the most popular diamond shapes:<br/><br/><strong>Round</strong><br/>The most classic and brilliant diamond shape, ideal for maximum light return<br/><br/><strong>Oval</strong><br/>Elongated and modern, creating the illusion of a larger stone on the finger<br/><br/><strong>Cushion</strong><br/>A soft, romantic cut that blends vintage charm with contemporary sparkle<br/><br/><strong>Emerald</strong><br/>Elegant step-cut faceting that emphasizes clarity and geometric beauty<br/><br/><strong>Princess</strong><br/>A square brilliant cut that delivers bold sparkle in a modern silhouette<br/><br/><strong>Pear</strong><br/>A teardrop shape that is distinctive, flattering, and eye-catching<br/><br/><strong>Marquise</strong> <br/>An elongated shape with pointed ends that maximizes carat weight</p>",
