              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_YiHMRV": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p><strong>What is a lab-grown diamond engagement ring?</strong><br/>A lab-grown diamond engagement ring features a diamond created in a controlled laboratory environment using advanced technology that replicates the natural diamond-forming process. Lab-grown diamonds are optically, physically, and chemically identical to mined diamonds.<br/><br/><strong>Are lab-grown diamonds real diamonds?</strong><br/>Yes. Lab-grown diamonds have the same crystal structure, chemical composition, hardness (10 on the Mohs scale), and optical properties as earth-mined diamonds. They are certified by the same grading organizations and are indistinguishable to the naked eye.<br/><br/><strong>What are conflict-free engagement rings?</strong><br/>Conflict-free engagement rings use diamonds and materials sourced through ethical, ecologically responsible, and socially conscious practices. Because all MiaDonna diamonds are lab-grown and our metals are recycled, every MiaDonna engagement ring is conflict-free.<br/><br/><strong>Can I design a custom lab-grown diamond engagement ring with MiaDonna?</strong><br/>Absolutely. MiaDonna offers a custom design service where you can choose from a range of settings, metals, and lab-grown diamonds or gemstones to create a ring that is uniquely yours. Our team guides you through every step of the process.<br/><br/><strong>What metals are available for MiaDonna lab-grown diamond engagement rings?</strong><br/>MiaDonna offers platinum, 14K and 18K white gold, yellow gold, and rose gold. All metals are recycled and responsibly sourced.<br/><br/><strong>How do I find the right ring size?</strong><br/>Use MiaDonna's online Ring Sizing Guide , or visit a local jeweler for a professional measurement. If the fit isn't perfect, every MiaDonna engagement ring includes one free resizing within 60 days of purchase.<br/><br/><strong>What are the most popular lab-grown diamond engagement ring settings?</strong><br/>The most popular settings at MiaDonna include classic solitaires, halo designs, three-stone rings, and vintage-inspired settings. Each style highlights the center diamond in a unique way.<br/><br/><strong>Can MiaDonna engagement rings be resized?</strong><br/>Yes. MiaDonna offers one complimentary resizing (up or down one full size) within 60 days of when your ring ships, including return shipping.<br/><br/><strong>Does MiaDonna have a physical store?</strong><br/>Yes. MiaDonna's flagship boutique is located in Portland, Oregon. You can visit the store to browse the collection, try on rings, and work with our jewelry experts in person.</p>",
